# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS. On a repo without branch protection this requests reviewers automatically
# but cannot block a merge; with protection it can be made mandatory.
/services/billing/   @your-org/billing
/services/auth/      @your-org/platform
/contracts/          @your-org/platform @your-org/billing
/libs/               @your-org/platform
/.github/            @your-org/platform
/.factory/           @your-org/platform
